    "slug": "harmbench",
    "displayName": "HarmBench",
    "aliases": ["Harm Bench"],
    "description": "Standardized red-teaming benchmark with 510 harmful behaviors (400 text, 110 multimodal) across standard, copyright, contextual, and multimodal categories. Attacks generate test cases; a classifier scores whether each completion elicits the behavior. The headline metric is attack success rate (ASR).",
    "summary": "Measures how often the model gives harmful output when attackers try to make it break its safety rules.",
    "maintainers": [
      {
        "name": "Center for AI Safety",
        "url": "https://github.com/centerforaisafety/HarmBench"
      }
    ],
    "links": [
